74 |   _ = f"b {f"abc" \
   |  __________^
75 | |     f"def"} g"
   | |__________^
76 |
77 |   # Explicitly concatenated nested f-strings
   |
help: Replace with explicit concatenation
   |
73 | _ = f"b {f"c" f"d {f"e" f"f"} g"} h"
   - _ = f"b {f"abc" \
   -     f"def"} g"
